{
  "controlWidth" : 12,
  "label" : "TextBlock1",
  "text" : "<div style=\"height: 250px; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #e8e8e8; font-size: 15px;\">\n<p><strong>Begin phone call:</strong><br />&ldquo;Hello, this is <span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">%UserName%</span> from ANZ Customer Resolution.<br />Have I called you at a good time to talk?&rdquo;<br /><br /><strong>Read Call Disclaimer:<br /></strong>For ANZ customers:<br />&bull;&nbsp; &ldquo;Just before I go on, I have to let you know that your call may be monitored and recorded for quality assurance purposes.&rdquo;<br /><br /><strong>Authenticate Customer:<br /></strong>(As per <a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/FlLCjU21Ee2RFABQVpUToA?fromMenu=VooCPU3fEe2RFABQVpUToA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Inbound </a>or <a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/6nuFM03fEe2RFABQVpUToA?fromMenu=sA7H6k5vEe2RFABQVpUToA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Outbound </a>Procedure as applicable).<br /><br /><strong>Purpose of Call:</strong><br />&ldquo;I&rsquo;m calling you today about your complaint.&rdquo;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Confirm complaint type:<br /></strong>&ldquo;Can I confirm, is your complaint about &lt;insert your understanding of the complaint so far&gt;?&rdquo;.</p>\n</div>",
  "show" : {
    "group" : {
      "operator" : "AND",
      "rules" : [ {
        "data" : "Customer_Complaint",
        "condition" : "=",
        "field" : "CaseType"
      }, {
        "field" : "BeginPhonecall:TalkTrackButtons:selectedButtonName",
        "condition" : "=",
        "data" : "Call Answered"
      } ]
    }
  },
  "dataJSON" : true,
  "HTMLTemplateId" : "",
  "textKey" : "",
  "sanitize" : false
}

{
  "sanitize" : false,
  "textKey" : "",
  "HTMLTemplateId" : "",
  "dataJSON" : true,
  "show" : {
    "group" : {
      "operator" : "AND",
      "rules" : [ {
        "data" : "Call Answered",
        "condition" : "=",
        "field" : "BeginPhonecall:TalkTrackButtons:selectedButtonName"
      }, {
        "field" : "CaseType",
        "condition" : "=",
        "data" : "Non_Customer_Complaint"
      } ]
    }
  },
  "text" : "<div style=\"height: 250px; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #e8e8e8; font-size: 15px;\">\n<p><strong>Begin phone call:</strong><br />&ldquo;Hello, this is <span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">%UserName%</span> from ANZ Customer Resolution.<br />Have I called you at a good time to talk?&rdquo;<br /><br /><strong>Read Call Disclaimer:<br /></strong>For non-ANZ customers:<br />&bull;&nbsp; &ldquo;Just before I go on, I have to let you know that your call may be monitored and recorded for quality assurance purposes. At ANZ, all personal information is handled in accordance with our privacy policy which is available at anz.com.&rdquo;</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>Authenticate Customer:<br /></strong>(As per <a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/FlLCjU21Ee2RFABQVpUToA?fromMenu=VooCPU3fEe2RFABQVpUToA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Inbound </a>or <a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/6nuFM03fEe2RFABQVpUToA?fromMenu=sA7H6k5vEe2RFABQVpUToA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Outbound </a>Procedure as applicable).<br /><br /><strong>Purpose of Call:</strong><br />&ldquo;I&rsquo;m calling you today about your complaint.&rdquo;</p>\n<p><strong>Confirm complaint type:<br /></strong>&ldquo;Can I confirm, is your complaint about &lt;insert your understanding of the complaint so far&gt;?&rdquo;.</p>\n</div>",
  "label" : "TextBlock1",
  "controlWidth" : 12
}

{
  "controlWidth" : 12,
  "height" : "30em",
  "label" : "TextBlock2",
  "text" : "<div style=\"border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; height: 250px; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #e8e8e8; font-size: 15px;\">\n<p><strong>Contact strategy<br /></strong>REVIEWED CUSTOMER CONTACT PREFERENCE<br />-Contact preference is &lt;phone/email&gt;<br />-Introduction &lt;email/SMS via <a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/Link/A2TDGuYPEeyRDABQVpUToA\" title=\"Whispir\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Whispir</a>&gt; template sent to customer<br />-(Copy &amp; Paste email/SMS text)<br /><br /><strong>Unsuccessful call attempt<br /></strong>CALLED CUSTOMER &ndash; DID NOT ANSWER OR DECLINED TO CONTINUE<br />&lt;Voice message left OR Unable to leave voice message&gt;<br />NEXT STEP<br />&lt;Call customer again/send an email/other&gt;</p>\n<p><strong>Customer answered phone<br /></strong>CALL WITH CUSTOMER &ndash; ANSWERED PHONE<br />-Identified customer &amp; read call disclaimer.<br />-Confirmed what the complaint was about.</p>\n<p>SITUATION:<br />-Customer explained that &lt;insert customer&rsquo;s explanation of complaint&gt;<br />-Customer believes that ANZ &lt;insert what customer feels ANZ did wrong&gt;<br />-Customer dissatisfied with their customer experience.</p>\n<p>TASK:<br />-Customer wanted ANZ to &lt;insert what customer wants as an outcome&gt;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>ACTION:<br />-I listened to the customer with empathy.<br />-I told customer we appreciate their feedback.<br />-(if applicable) I also &lt;describe any actions taken or information provided&gt;</p>\n<p>RESULT:<br />-ANZ &lt;has made/has not made&gt; an error<br />-&lt;insert any other important observations&gt;<br />-Customer accepting/not accepting of complaint outcome.</p>\n<p>NEXT STEP<br />-To (If applicable) &lt;escalate case/send written response&gt;<br />-To &lt;close case/action webvoucher&gt;&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
  "show" : {
    "group" : {
      "operator" : "AND",
      "rules" : [ {
        "data" : "Case comment templates",
        "condition" : "=",
        "field" : "BeginPhonecall:TalkTrackButtons:selectedButtonName"
      } ]
    }
  },
  "dataJSON" : true,
  "HTMLTemplateId" : "",
  "textKey" : "",
  "sanitize" : false
}

{
  "sanitize" : false,
  "textKey" : "",
  "HTMLTemplateId" : "",
  "dataJSON" : true,
  "show" : {
    "group" : {
