{
  "controlWidth" : 12,
  "label" : "TextBlock1",
  "text" : "<div style=\"border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; height: 250px; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #e8e8e8; font-size: 15px;\">\n<p><strong>If customer wants to continue phone conversation at another time:<br /></strong>&ldquo;I&rsquo;m happy to continue this discussion at a more convenient time. When might be best for you?&rdquo;<br />(agree on a date/time with customer for you to call them back)<br />&ldquo;I will speak to you again &lt;repeat time and date agreed&gt;.&rdquo;</p>\n<p>(END CALL)</p>\n<p><strong>If customer<br /></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>doesn&rsquo;t want to continue phone conversation at another time, AND/OR </strong></li>\n<li><strong>prefers a written response.<br /></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>\"I'll send you my written response to your complaint.\"</p>\n<p>(END CALL)</p>\n<div>\n<p><strong>If customer</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>refuses to speak to you to discuss the complaint at all, AND</strong></li>\n<li><strong>says they don&rsquo;t want a written response either:</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&ldquo;ANZ has an obligation to give you a written response. However, if you don&rsquo;t want this, we can withdraw your complaint. Would you like me to do that on your behalf?&rdquo;<br /><br /><strong>(If customer says yes &ndash; withdraw complaint)</strong><br /><strong>(If customer says no &ndash; explain to customer):<br /></strong>&ldquo;Unfortunately, as you don&rsquo;t want to withdraw the complaint, we are required to send you a written response which will include AFCA&rsquo;s details so you can escalate further if you wish.&rdquo;<br /><br /><strong>(END CALL)</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "show" : {
    "group" : {
      "operator" : "AND",
      "rules" : [ {
        "data" : "Unable to continue call",
        "condition" : "=",
        "field" : "BeginPhonecall:TalkTrackButtons:selectedButtonName"
      } ]
    }
  },
  "dataJSON" : true,
  "HTMLTemplateId" : "",
  "textKey" : "",
  "sanitize" : false,
  "lwcComponentOverride" : ""
}

{
  "controlWidth" : 12,
  "label" : "TextBlock2",
  "text" : "<div style=\"border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; height: 250px; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #e8e8e8; font-size: 15px;\">\n<p><strong>If customer identified themselves in their voicemail (mentioned their name), leave a&nbsp;</strong><br /><strong>voice message:</strong><br />&ldquo;Hi <span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">%FirstName%</span>, this is <span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">%UserName%</span> calling from ANZ&rsquo;s Customer Resolution Team regarding reference number <span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">%CaseNumber%</span>. Please call me at your earliest convenience on<span style=\"color: #e67e23;\"> +61 (3) 93112267</span> to discuss further.&rdquo;<br /><br /><strong>If customer did NOT identify themselves in their voicemail (did not mention their name) </strong><strong>leave a voice message:</strong><br />&ldquo;Hi <span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">%FirstName%</span>, this is <span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">%UserName%</span> calling from ANZ. Please call me at your earliest convenience on <span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">+61 (3) 93112267</span> and quote reference <span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">%CaseNumber%</span>.&rdquo;</p>\n</div>",
  "show" : {
    "group" : {
      "operator" : "AND",
      "rules" : [ {
        "data" : "Voicemail",
        "condition" : "=",
        "field" : "BeginPhonecall:TalkTrackButtons:selectedButtonName"
      } ]
    }
  },
  "dataJSON" : true,
  "HTMLTemplateId" : "",
  "textKey" : "",
  "sanitize" : false
}

