  "text" : "<div style=\"font-size: 15px; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; height: 200px; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #e8e8e8;\"><strong>Financial remedy actioned in Webvoucher<br /></strong> <br />GOODWILL PAYMENT SUBMITTED <br />-Processed web voucher into account ending &lt;XXXX&gt;<br />-Amount: $XXXX <br />-Transaction ID - &lt;insert copied and pasted transaction ID&gt;<br />&lt;insert copied and pasted onscreen payment details from Webvoucher&gt;<br />NEXT STEP -<br />To close case<br /><br /><strong>Case closure<br /></strong> <br />CASE IS NOW CLOSED <br />&lt;If applicable: Include any other actions taken or relevant information&gt;</div>",
