{
  "sanitize" : false,
  "textKey" : "",
  "HTMLTemplateId" : "",
  "dataJSON" : true,
  "show" : {
    "group" : {
      "operator" : "AND",
      "rules" : [ {
        "data" : "Complex additional issues",
        "condition" : "=",
        "field" : "ConsiderAdditionalIssues:TalkTrackAddtionalIssue:selectedButtonName"
      } ]
    }
  },
  "text" : "<div style=\"font-size: 15px; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; height: 200px; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #e8e8e8;\">\n<p><strong>Acknowledge complex <a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/98KjePeyEe6RKwBQVpUToA\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"'Simple complaints&rsquo; Process flow\" rel=\"noopener\">additional issue</a> (for reallocation):<br /></strong></p>\n<p>&ldquo;That sounds like something which should be investigated further.<br /><br />What I can do for you today is to arrange to escalate your complaint to a specialised team member to investigate. I will leave notes of our discussion today so that our specialised team member is aware of the concerns you have shared with me today.<br /><br />They will contact you to discuss the matter in detail. You can expect to hear from them within the next week or so.&nbsp;<br />Thanks again for taking my call and enjoy the rest of your day.&rdquo;<br />(END CALL)<br /><br /><strong>&bull; Inform your team leader that the case should be reallocated to a specialised case </strong><strong>management team for further investigation.</strong><br /><strong>&bull; (If applicable) Reassign case to relevant Workbasket.</strong><br /><strong>&bull; Exit pathway.</strong></p>\n</div>",
  "label" : "TextBlock1",
  "controlWidth" : 12
}

