  "text" : "<div style=\"font-size: 15px; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; height: 200px; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #e8e8e8;\">\n<p><strong>If <a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/yhHoxYkXEeakaQBQVpxDEQ?fromMenu=U3RzFB9jEeyRAQBQVpUToA\" title=\"Customer Resolution Discretions Framework for Customer Complaints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">financial remedy</a> is not appropriate AND/OR the customer hasn&rsquo;t requested it, proceed to next step.</strong></p>\n</div>",
