  "text" : "<div style=\"font-size: 15px; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; height: 200px; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #e8e8e8;\">\n<p><strong>If offering <a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/yhHoxYkXEeakaQBQVpxDEQ?fromMen%20u=U3RzFB9jEeyRAQBQVpUToA\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Customer Resolution Discretions Framework for Customer Complaints\" rel=\"noopener\">financial remedy</a>:<br /><br /></strong></p>\n<p>&ldquo;In recognition of the issue that occurred, I&rsquo;d like to offer you &lt;$XXXX&gt; to resolve and close this matter. Does this resolve your complaint today?&rdquo;</p>\n</div>",
  "label" : "TextBlock1",
