{
  "controlWidth" : 12,
  "label" : "TextBlock1",
  "text" : "<div style=\"font-size: 15px; height: 200px; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #e8e8e8;\">\n<p><strong>If customer accepts offer:<br /><br /></strong></p>\n<p>&ldquo;Great, I will action that for you now and make a note of how we have agreed to resolve this complaint.</p>\n<p>It will be paid into your ANZ bank account ending &lt;insert ending account number for customer's DDA&gt; and will be available in your account within five business days.</p>\n<p>I will also close your complaint.&rdquo;<br /><br /></p>\n<p><strong>If customer declines offer, or indicates they don&rsquo;t want this outcome:<br /><br /></strong></p>\n<p>&ldquo;Ok, I understand your position. I won&rsquo;t action that payment then.&rdquo;</p>\n</div>",
  "show" : {
    "group" : {
      "operator" : "AND",
      "rules" : [ {
        "data" : "Next steps for financial remedy",
        "condition" : "=",
        "field" : "Considerfinancialremedy:FinancialRemedyTalkTrack:selectedButtonName"
      } ]
    }
  },
  "dataJSON" : true,
  "HTMLTemplateId" : "",
  "textKey" : "",
  "sanitize" : false
}

{
  "sanitize" : false,
  "textKey" : "",
  "HTMLTemplateId" : "",
  "dataJSON" : true,
  "show" : {
    "group" : {
      "operator" : "AND",
      "rules" : [ {
        "data" : "Decline financial remedy request",
        "condition" : "=",
        "field" : "Considerfinancialremedy:FinancialRemedyTalkTrack:selectedButtonName"
      } ]
    }
  },
  "text" : "<div style=\"font-size: 15px; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; height: 200px; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #e8e8e8;\">\n<p><strong>If not appropriate, respectfully decline request for <a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/yhHoxYkXEeakaQBQVpxDEQ?fromMen%20u=U3RzFB9jEeyRAQBQVpUToA\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Customer Resolution Discretions Framework for Customer Complaints\" rel=\"noopener\">financial remedy</a> :<br /><br /></strong></p>\n<p>&ldquo;Whilst we don&rsquo;t provide compensation to customers for this, we appreciate your feedback and I have recorded it.&rdquo;</p>\n</div>",
  "label" : "TextBlock1",
  "controlWidth" : 12
}

{
  "controlWidth" : 12,
  "label" : "TextBlock1",
  "text" : "<div style=\"font-size: 15px; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; height: 200px; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #e8e8e8;\">\n<p><strong>If the customer appears satisfied with complaint outcome, check <a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/Z0PTP9s_EeiqeAAd2Lcd9A?fromMenu=WwPBcts_EeiqeAAd2Lcd9A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">if a written response is required</a> as per Knowhow.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>If the customer appears to have accepted your complaint outcome:<br /></strong><br />&ldquo;Thank you for your time today. I hope I&rsquo;ve addressed your concern. I&rsquo;ll close out your complaint.&rdquo;</p>\n<p><strong>AND (<a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/Z0PTP9s_EeiqeAAd2Lcd9A?fromMenu=WwPBcts_EeiqeAAd2Lcd9A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">if a written response is required</a>):</strong></p>\n<p>&ldquo;I&rsquo;ll also send you a written response to your complaint.&rdquo;</p>\n<p>(END CALL)</p>\n</div>",
  "show" : {
    "group" : {
      "operator" : "AND",
      "rules" : [ {
        "data" : "Outcome accepted",
        "condition" : "=",
        "field" : "EndPhoneCall:EndPhoneCallButtons:selectedButtonName"
      } ]
    }
  },
  "dataJSON" : true,
  "HTMLTemplateId" : "",
  "textKey" : "",
  "sanitize" : false
}

