  "text" : "<div style=\"font-size: 15px; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; height: 200px; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #e8e8e8;\">\n<p><a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/File/O6rwq_FzEe6RKgBQVpUToA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><strong>Check if a <a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/Z0PTP9s_EeiqeAAd2Lcd9A?fromMenu=WwPBcts_EeiqeAAd2Lcd9A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">written IDR response</a> is required as per Knowhow.</strong></p>\n<br />\n<p><strong>Customer dissatisfied with resolution<br /></strong>&bull; EMAIL: <a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/File/ysiuYPF8Ee6RKgBQVpUToA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Customer dissatisfied with resolution</a><br />&bull; LETTER: <a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/File/KRZauPFzEe6RKgBQVpUToA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Customer dissatisfied with resolution</a></p>\n<br />\n<p><strong>Written response requested OR otherwise required</strong><br />&bull; EMAIL: <a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/File/6ah5UPF8Ee6RKgBQVpUToA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Written response requested OR required</a><br />&bull; LETTER: <a href=\"https://portal.knowhow.service.anz/C/File/O6rwq_FzEe6RKgBQVpUToA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Written response requested OR required</a></p>\n</div>",
